# svc-pokecenter-day: the nurse's day greeting, on the US build (services.rom.test.ts). The morning's, in
# svc-pokecenter, holds on every build; the day's message differs by language (docs/research/german-rom.md).
party 0 platinum:SPECIES_TURTWIG 9 platinum:MOVE_TACKLE platinum:MOVE_WITHDRAW
time 12:00
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_JUBILIFE_CITY_POKECENTER_1F 8 6
until idle
+0 assert facing player up
+1 press a
+1 release a
until message
+0 assert text platinum:CommonStrings_Text_PokecenterGreeting_Day 0
advance text
+0 assert message open
+0 assert text platinum:CommonStrings_Text_PokecenterGreeting_Day 2
